    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Connect the nodes and hack the Dungeon!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Algolemeth is an RPG where you control golem behavior through visual programming and conquer dungeons fully automatically.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge the Dungeon through Trial and Error!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731030/extras/e0cf9c3a338048ec26be1b7571791176.poster.avif?t=1752208689\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731030/extras/e0cf9c3a338048ec26be1b7571791176.webm?t=1752208689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731030/extras/e0cf9c3a338048ec26be1b7571791176.mp4?t=1752208689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>As an alchemist, players create autonomously operating golems, forming parties to undertake automatic dungeon conquests. Once the golems are dispatched into the dungeon, all you can do is watch. Analyze enemy actions, iterate through trial and error, and aim to conquer the dungeon! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring Back Parts and Strengthen Your Golems!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731030/extras/a8c8483810491cc3c6a588544c5147f3.poster.avif?t=1752208689\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731030/extras/a8c8483810491cc3c6a588544c5147f3.webm?t=1752208689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731030/extras/a8c8483810491cc3c6a588544c5147f3.mp4?t=1752208689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Various enhancement parts can be found in the dungeon. Among them are those that directly increase the golem's physical abilities and modules that allow for new action logic. Create your own unique golems with the parts you acquire! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not Just Battle, But Fully Automated Exploration!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731030/extras/64b5526cb469170866e72812a630ddaf.poster.avif?t=1752208689\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731030/extras/64b5526cb469170866e72812a630ddaf.webm?t=1752208689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731030/extras/64b5526cb469170866e72812a630ddaf.mp4?t=1752208689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Players can control exploration actions in the dungeon using exploration ModuleRack. Decide who will unlock the treasure chest, whether to continue exploring based on current health status, or whether to retreat. The actions of your party are dependent on the AI you've created.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Legendary composer Yuzo Koshiro sets the tone with an all-new soundtrack!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having scored countless classic games, Koshiro now handles our BGM\u2014every track rendered in true Genesis-style FM synth to fire you up on your dungeon conquest!</p>",
